{
  "$doc": [
    "Every Playwright test module in apps/web-console, pinned to the exact set of projects",
    "that collect it. Enforced by scripts/verify-spec-collection.mjs, which runs in the",
    "required 'Web console (type + unit + build)' CI job and needs no live stack.",
    "",
    "Adding a spec: add its line here, with the project(s) that run it. A spec no project",
    "collects can never fail, so the guard rejects it.",
    "Deleting or rewiring a spec on purpose: that is the one-line edit below, made in the",
    "same PR. If the line changes and nobody meant to change it, the spec went dark by",
    "accident, which is what this file exists to catch.",
    "",
    "Project names come from playwright.config.ts, e2e/phase-19/owui/playwright.owui.config.ts",
    "and e2e/chat-coverage/playwright.chat-coverage.config.ts.",
    "The owui projects and the live chat-coverage project gate their testMatch on credentials,",
    "so the guard lists those configs with placeholders to keep collection deterministic",
    "everywhere.",
    "",
    "`configs` pins each config to the projects it declares, verified by the same guard from the",
    "same listing. tools/verify-spec-wiring.mjs reads it to resolve a workflow's `--config` and",
    "`--project` arguments into a set of spec files without importing any config file itself."
  ],
